            "content": "<p>Hardbacks leave within two working days and arrive in 3 to 7. Shipping is free over $50. Printed books can be returned within 30 days; ebooks are refunded within 14 days if not downloaded. <a href=\"/pages/shipping\">Shipping in full</a></p>",
